# XP & Rating System Redesign

We will overhaul the progression and competitive systems to create a more engaging experience. This involves decoupling XP (for levels) from Rating (for leaderboards), data resets, and improved UI feedback.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Data Reset**: This plan includes clearing all existing user stats, XP, and Elo ratings to ensure a clean transition to the new system. This will be done by setting values to 0/initial states in the next sync.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Level Formula**: We will use `Level = sqrt(totalXP / 100)`. For example, Level 10 requires 10,000 XP.

